      "title": "5.2.1 Measures of Central Tendency (Mean, Median, Mode)",
      "language": "en",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_document_id": "8edd9572-2b0a-521f-a398-b6e8104a4eb3",
          "pdf_from": 128,
          "pdf_to": 128,
          "note": "Topic 5.2.1 (PDF 128, printed 125). The book omits the result of its mean example; 350 / 5 = 70 is worked here."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Measures of central tendency find the centre, or typical value, of a data set. There are three: mean, median and mode."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "Mean, median and mode",
            "header": [
              "Measure",
              "How to find it",
              "Example"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Mean",
                "add all values and divide by how many",
                "50, 60, 70, 80, 90: 350 / 5 = 70"
              ],
              [
                "Median",
                "middle value in order; for an even count, average the two middle values",
                "50, 60, 70, 80, 90: 70; 50, 60, 70, 80: (60 + 70) / 2 = 65"
              ],
              [
                "Mode",
                "the most frequent value; there can be more than one",
                "50, 60, 70, 70, 90: 70; 50, 60, 70, 70, 60, 90: 60 and 70"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "Find the mean, median and mode of 4, 7, 7, 9, 13.",
            "explanation": "Mean = 40 / 5 = 8; median = 7 (the middle value); mode = 7."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Quick recap"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Mean: average; median: middle value; mode: most frequent value."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
